    "turn_idx": 3,
    "turn_text": "And hello everybody and welcome to Beach Talk Radio, episode number 161 coming to you live from peach time out on Fort Myers Beach. As always, video the show is available on our Facebook and YouTube pages. We're on Twitter and Instagram and our news website is BeachTalkRadioNews.com where you can sign up for our free twice a week newsletter, download our news app so you can receive breaking news from Fort Myers Beach when it happens. And as always, thank you to our great local supporting businesses, Island Oils, Fort Myers, Tiki Tours, Nervous Nellies, Mangarita, State Insurance USA, Sun Palace Vacation, Laola Restaurant, Tuckaway Cafe, Blue Ribbon Events, Beach Pottery, Sunset, Tropical Grill, and Shuckers, and of course our longest running supporters since show number one back on August 5th, 2018, Pete's time out. We want to say welcome to Congressman Byron Donald's, a big round of applause from our artificial audience. Thank you so much for coming back on the show.",
