        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "The topics discussed while campaigning are specific and regionally relevant, including water quality, tax policy, constitutional issues, and immigration.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Once in office, representatives handle issues from across the country and around the world.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "New issues can emerge suddenly and require immediate attention.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Fundraising is ongoing and continuous during congressional service.",
