    "turn_text": "of me dropping out. And incidentally, what happened was in 2014, when there was the congressional primary, I did an interview with Fox for saying that I was not going to run. I was going to spend time with my family back in 2014. And you could tell it was 2014 because I didn't have a beard. Like he's like a go team. I was like, I'm watching the news clip. Like if anybody looks at this, they're like, wait a minute. This guy has a beer. Like, how did he shave it? Yeah. But at any rate, so they doctored that footage. The people who did it, whoever did it, they doctored that footage. Wow. and created a fake page. So we had to go to code, go to YouTube. We actually had to have YouTube correctly take something down and we actually went through the proper process to get something removed off social media. We had to go to the company that was sending the text messages, letting them know that it was not me and what was happening and that they went and pulled that stuff down. They stopped sending them out. And when we went back and kind of did our own internal investigation, we took all our findings and we gave, turned it over to FBI for them to go with it. Who do you think did it? I, the part about this then is where I, I've stepped back and I don't want to get into that part. Okay. Because if you're wrong, then you're",
