    "turn_idx": 165,
    "turn_text": "Nobody saw that coming. Let me say this, nobody saw that coming. The one thing that I find very interesting is during the impeachment trial, at one point, the Democrats wanted to call Jamie Butler Herrera out of Washington. She's a Republican member out of Washington state. And so the Republicans were like, okay, well, if you're going to call her to testify, we're going to call Nancy Pelosi, because what they wanted to see was did Nancy Pelosi know something or what she asked to provide additional support to the Capitol on that day? Once it was clear that she was going to have to testify, they pulled the request for people to testify in the impeachment hearing, because they didn't want to put Nancy Pelosi on the record. because they put her on the record, she would have had to testify that Capitol Police went to her asking for additional support that day for that day, and she said no.",
